  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "\\(x^2-4x+4=x^2-2\\cdot x\\cdot2+2^2=(x-2)^2\\). In \\(x^2+4x+16\\), the middle term would need to be \\(\\pm8x\\); the other polynomials also do not fit the form \\(a^2\\pm2ab+b^2\\).",
